OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed man was in other
OL,4,Acrashes - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who killed a young father of
OL,7,Ftwo in a crash in Nottingham had been
OL,8,Finvolved in three other collisions
OL,9,Fbeforehand, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FNomazwe Moyo was jailed for 12 years in
OL,12,FJune after admitting causing the death
OL,13,Fof 20-year-old Muhammad Aftab Ahmad,
OL,14,Fwho was riding a moped, on the A610
OL,15,FBobbers Mill Bridge, in Alfreton Road,
OL,16,Fin October 2025.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
