OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed man was in other
OL,4,Acrashes - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, an inquest into Ahmad's
OL,7,Fdeath heard Moyo had been diagnosed
OL,8,Fwith "probable epilepsy", advised not
OL,9,Fto drive and told she had to inform the
OL,10,FDVLA of her condition, but did not
OL,11,Ffollow this advice.
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police, the inquest was
OL,14,Ftold, had been called to three earlier
OL,15,Fcollisions involving Moyo in the years
OL,16,Fprior to the fatal crash.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
